USDA
United States Department of Agriculture
Research, Education, and Economics
Agricultural Research Service
CITY CONTRACT#150
APPROVED
May 7, 2021
By Alessandra at 10:14am, May07,2021
City Clerk's Office
2101O'Neil Avenue, Room101
Cheyenne, Wyoming82001
Dear Sir or Madam:
SUBJECT: Notice of Renewal: Lease Number 57-82HW-1-0171,1,998 Acres of Land
City Contract #150
Annual rent is S1.00, receipt of which is acknowledged
In accordance with the terms of the above-referenced lease, the United States of America, acting by
and through the Agricultural Research Service, is sendingthis notice ofrenewal to provide you with
30daysnotice ofits option to renew said lease for the period of10/1/2021 through9/30/2022.All
conditions and provisions of the said lease andany amendments thereto, are hereby extended to
cover the renewal option period.
The considerations, acts, promises, agreements, and provisions to be executed and performed by
each party to said lease shall remain in full force and effectfor the above-referenced period.This
renewal is conditioned upon the passages of an applicable appropriation or authorization by
Congress from which this expenditure may bemade and shall not obligate the United States upon
failure of Congress to so act.
If you concur with extending the renewalfor one more period as listed above, please initial the
concurrence linebelow andretaina copy foryour filesbefore returning this notice to the address
below.
Lessor Concurrence:
(initials) Patrick Collins, Mayor
ATTEST
SEAL
Sincerely,
ne
